1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
Now you are back in your original position.

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:07,920
Look at your right arm.

3
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:10,320
Move it.

4
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:15,840
Notice how the intention and what you see do not match.

5
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:18,960
Which one is correct?

6
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:23,600
If they disagree, which one is you?

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:27,760
Or are both simply appearing?

8
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:33,520
Please raise your right hand in front of you and notice your hand.

9
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:38,320
Please place your right hand on your left shoulder.

10
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:45,920
Please raise your left hand and notice your hand.

11
00:00:45,920 --> 00:00:50,640
Please place your left hand on your right shoulder.

12
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:54,880
Now place both hands on your lap.

13
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:00,880
You don't need to resolve this.

14
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:04,880
The intention to move, the sensation of moving,

15
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:10,080
and what you see are simply three things that appear.

16
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:15,200
None of them has to be you for awareness to be here.

17
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:18,320
Now just observe.

